<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Siap TKA Seri 04 Bahasa Indonesia SMP - Versi 1.1 Pro Cloud</title>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://script.google.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://script.googleusercontent.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Allura&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS via CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        primary: '#6E1F26',      
                        bgcream: '#F8F3EA',      
                        accent: '#D8A5A5',       
                        secondary: '#C9A96A',    
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        allura: ['Allura', 'cursive'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    
    <style>
        #cbt-app-root {
            position: fixed !important;
            top: 0 !important;
            left: 0 !important;
            width: 100vw !important;
            height: 100dvh !important;
            z-index: 999999 !important; 
            background-color: #F8F3EA !important;
            overflow: hidden !important;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
            display: block !important;
            opacity: 1 !important;
            visibility: visible !important;
        }

        body, html {
            margin: 0 !important;
            padding: 0 !important;
            overflow: hidden !important;
            height: 100% !important;
        }

        .page { display: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease-in-out; }
        .page.active { display: flex; opacity: 1; }
        
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #D8A5A5; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #6E1F26; }

        .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .hide-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }

        .wacana-content p { margin-bottom: 1em; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify; }
        .wacana-content h3 { font-size: 1.15em; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75em; color: #6E1F26; }
        /* Tabel, daftar, dan elemen khusus di dalam wacana tidak perlu rata kiri-kanan */
        .wacana-content table, .wacana-content th, .wacana-content td,
        .wacana-content ul, .wacana-content ol, .wacana-content li { text-align: left; }
        .wacana-content table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 1em; font-size: 0.92em; }
        .wacana-content th, .wacana-content td { border: 1px solid #E5D9C3; padding: 6px 10px; }
        .wacana-content th { background-color: #F1E4CC; font-weight: 700; color: #6E1F26; }

        /* Bingkai teks bacaan, dibedakan warnanya dari area soal */
        #wacana-container { background-color: #FBF7EE !important; }
        .wacana-box {
            background-color: #FFFDF8;
            border: 1px solid #E9DDC3;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(110, 31, 38, 0.06);
        }
        .soal-box {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid #D9D2E9;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(60, 40, 100, 0.06);
        }

        .unselectable {
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -ms-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- WRAPPER UTAMA CBT -->
    <div id="cbt-app-root" class="text-gray-800">

        <!-- OVERLAY FREEZE ANTI-CURANG -->
        <div id="freeze-overlay" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/95 z-[999999] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white p-4">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-red-500 mb-4 text-center">UJIAN DIBEKUKAN!</h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mb-6 text-center max-w-lg">Anda terdeteksi melakukan pelanggaran (berpindah tab/layar/minimize browser) sebanyak 3 kali.<br>Ujian dibekukan selama 5 Menit.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-yellow-400 mb-6 text-center">Memuat ulang halaman (refresh) tidak akan menghilangkan hukuman ini.</p>
            <div class="text-7xl font-bold text-secondary mb-4" id="freeze-timer">300</div>
            <p class="text-lg">Detik tersisa</p>
        </div>

        <!-- HALAMAN 1: LANDING PAGE -->
        <div id="page-landing" class="page active flex-col items-center justify-center h-full w-full px-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 pb-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-12 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex flex-col items-center max-w-md w-full border-t-8 border-primary relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-accent rounded-full opacity-20"></div>
                <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-32 h-32 bg-secondary rounded-full opacity-20"></div>
                
                <img src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjraKX5mW7MSiEmwXC4ruwLCYyVkeFATlAvvbIvYW9MPa6fezUpco0orsjv5d6yZn7qBRoTBb3hzJKd3i3mnh0FGNhyphenhyphenwcFi5iEMZZodBRiZNKHEgGqy3x6RGX0t3NX7rVu-1cnoS2eYJsorwRHWODjpxWpxTXNJDXaQv2d6RCNxfYxLngLlfFQ7NlOx-z-V/s320/Logo%20Devi.png" alt="Logo Utama" class="w-32 h-32 object-contain mb-2 z-10" style="mix-blend-mode: multiply;">
                
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary text-center mb-1 tracking-tight z-10">SIAP TKA</h1>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary text-center mb-1 z-10">Bahasa Indonesia SMP</h2>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary text-center mb-1 z-7">• Seri 04</h3>
                <div class="w-full px-1 sm:px-0 mb-4 z-10 flex justify-center">
                    <p class="text-[9px] min-[375px]:text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium tracking-tight sm:tracking-wide text-center uppercase whitespace-nowrap">
                        Sesuai Kisi-kisi TKA &bull; CBT Profesional &bull; Anti-Curang
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 mb-4 z-10">Versi 1.1 Pro Cloud</p>
                
                <div class="w-full space-y-2 z-10 mt-1">
                    <button onclick="navigate('page-siswa-auth')" class="group relative w-full flex justify-center items-center py-3 px-4 border border-transparent text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold rounded-xl text-white bg-secondary hover:bg-yellow-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-3.957l1.818.78a3 3 0 002.364 0l5.508-2.361a11.026 11.026 0 01.25 3.762 1 1 0 01-.89.89 8.968 8.968 0 00-5.35 2.524 1 1 0 01-1.4 0zM6 18a1 1 0 001-1v-2.065a8.935 8.935 0 00-2-.712V17a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg>
                        Masuk sebagai Siswa
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="navigate('page-guru-auth')" class="group relative w-full flex justify-center items-center py-3 px-4 border border-transparent text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold rounded-xl text-white bg-primary hover:bg-red-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-primary transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 9a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zm-7 9a7 7 0 1114 0H3z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                        Masuk sebagai Guru
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-8 text-center text-gray-500">
                <p class="text-sm">Dikembangkan oleh</p>
                <p class="font-allura text-[25.5px] text-primary cursor-pointer select-none hover:text-accent transition-colors" onclick="triggerEasterEgg()">Susana Devi Anggasari, S.Pd.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HALAMAN 2: AUTH GURU -->
        <div id="page-guru-auth" class="page flex-col items-center justify-center h-full w-full">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg max-w-md w-full border-l-4 border-primary overflow-y-auto max-h-[90vh]">
                <button onclick="resetGuruAuth()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-primary mb-4 flex items-center text-sm">
                    &larr; Kembali
                </button>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Portal Guru</h2>
                
                <div id="guru-auth-step1">
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Token Masuk Guru</label>
                    <input type="text" id="guru-master-token" required placeholder="Masukkan Token Akses" class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-primary uppercase">
                    <button type="button" id="btn-verify-master" onclick="verifyMasterToken()" class="mt-4 w-full py-2 px-4 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-primary hover:bg-red-900 font-medium">Lanjut</button>
                </div>

                <div id="guru-auth-step2" class="hidden">
                    <div class="flex mb-4 border-b">
                        <button id="tab-login-guru" onclick="switchGuruTab('login')" class="flex-1 py-2 font-semibold text-primary border-b-2 border-primary">Masuk</button>
                        <button id="tab-daftar-guru" onclick="switchGuruTab('daftar')" class="flex-1 py-2 font-semibold text-gray-400">Buat Ruang</button>
                    </div>

                    <form id="form-guru-login" onsubmit="handleGuruLogin(event)" class="space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Nama Guru</label>
                            <input type="text" id="guru-login-nama" required class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-primary">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">PIN Keamanan</label>
                            <div class="relative mt-1">
                                <input type="password" id="guru-login-pin" required class="block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-primary pr-10">
                                <button type="button" onclick="togglePassword('guru-login-pin')" class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 pr-3 flex items-center text-gray-500 hover:text-primary" title="Tampilkan/Sembunyikan Sandi">👁️</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" id="btn-login-guru" class="w-full py-2 px-4 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-primary hover:bg-red-900 font-medium">Masuk Dashboard</button>
                    </form>

                    <form id="form-guru-daftar" onsubmit="handleGuruDaftar(event)" class="space-y-4 hidden">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Nama Guru</label>
                            <input type="text" id="guru-daftar-nama" required class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Buat Token Ujian (Unik untuk Siswa)</label>
                            <input type="text" id="guru-daftar-token" required class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md uppercase">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Wajib Buat PIN Keamanan</label>
                            <div class="relative mt-1">
                                <input type="password" id="guru-daftar-pin" required class="block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-secondary pr-10">
                                <button type="button" onclick="togglePassword('guru-daftar-pin')" class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 pr-3 flex items-center text-gray-500 hover:text-primary" title="Tampilkan/Sembunyikan Sandi">👁️</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" id="btn-daftar-guru" class="w-full py-2 px-4 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-secondary hover:bg-yellow-600 font-medium">Buat Ruang Ujian Cloud</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HALAMAN 3: AUTH SISWA -->
        <div id="page-siswa-auth" class="page flex-col items-center justify-center h-full w-full">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg max-w-md w-full border-r-4 border-secondary overflow-y-auto max-h-[90vh]">
                <button onclick="navigate('page-landing')" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-primary mb-4 flex items-center text-sm">
                    &larr; Kembali
                </button>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">Masuk Ujian</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Silakan isi data diri dan token dari guru Anda.</p>
                
                <form onsubmit="handleSiswaLogin(event)" class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Nama Lengkap</label>
                        <input type="text" id="siswa-nama" required class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-secondary">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Kelas</label>
                        <select id="siswa-kelas" required class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-secondary">
                            <option value="" disabled selected>Pilih Kelas</option>
                            <option value="IX-A">IX-A</option>
                            <option value="IX-B">IX-B</option>
                            <option value="IX-C">IX-C</option>
                            <option value="IX-D">IX-D</option>
                            <option value="IX-E">IX-E</option>
                            <option value="IX-F">IX-F</option>
                            <option value="IX-G">IX-G</option>
                            <option value="IX-H">IX-H</option>
                            <option value="IX-I">IX-I</option>
                            <option value="IX-J">IX-J</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Asal Sekolah</label>
                        <select id="siswa-asal-sekolah-pilihan" required onchange="toggleSekolahManual()" class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-secondary">
                            <option value="" disabled selected>Pilih Sekolah</option>
                            <option value="SMP Negeri 1 Singorojo">SMP Negeri 1 Singorojo</option>
                            <option value="__LAINNYA__">Sekolah Lain (ketik manual)</option>
                        </select>
                        <input type="text" id="siswa-asal-sekolah-manual" placeholder="Ketik nama sekolah" class="mt-2 hidden block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-secondary">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Token Ujian</label>
                        <input type="text" id="siswa-token" required class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-secondary uppercase">
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-md text-xs text-red-700 text-justify leading-relaxed">
                        <strong>PERINGATAN:</strong> Ujian ini dilengkapi sistem Anti-Curang yang memblokir klik kanan, copy-paste, serta batas waktu <strong>40 Menit</strong>. Dilarang berpindah tab, meminimalkan peramban, atau membuka aplikasi lain. Pelanggaran berulang akan membuat ujian Anda <strong>dibekukan selama 5 menit</strong>!
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-2 flex items-start">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="siswa-janji" required class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 text-secondary focus:ring-secondary border-gray-300 rounded cursor-pointer">
                        <label for="siswa-janji" class="ml-2 block text-xs text-gray-700 text-justify cursor-pointer">Saya berjanji akan mengerjakan ujian dengan jujur dan memahami aturan larangan berpindah layar aplikasi/peramban.</label>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="w-full py-3 mt-4 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-secondary hover:bg-yellow-600 font-bold text-lg">Mulai Kerjakan</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HALAMAN 4: DASHBOARD GURU -->
        <div id="page-guru-dash" class="page flex-col h-full w-full">
            <header class="bg-primary text-white p-4 shadow-md flex justify-between items-center">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Dashboard Guru</h1>
                    <p class="text-sm text-accent" id="dash-guru-info">Nama Guru | Token: XXXX</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <button onclick="sinkronDataDariCloud(true)" class="px-3 py-2 bg-secondary text-white rounded-md font-semibold text-xs hover:bg-yellow-600">⚡ Refresh Data</button>
                    <button onclick="logout()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-white text-primary rounded-md font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-gray-100">Keluar</button>
                </div>
            </header>
            <main class="flex-1 p-8 overflow-y-auto">
                <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Rekap Nilai Siswa (Cloud)</h2>
                        <button onclick="exportExcel('tabel-nilai-guru', 'Rekap_Nilai_CBT')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-green-700 shadow-sm font-medium">Export ke Excel (.xls)</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden">
                        <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200" id="tabel-nilai-guru">
                            <thead class="bg-gray-50">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">No</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Nama Siswa</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Kelas</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Asal Sekolah</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Nilai (100)</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Waktu Selesai</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Pelanggaran</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200" id="tbody-guru-dash"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </main>
        </div>

        <!-- HALAMAN 5: DASHBOARD SUPER ADMIN -->
        <div id="page-admin-dash" class="page flex-col h-full w-full">
            <header class="bg-gray-900 text-white p-4 shadow-md flex justify-between items-center">
                <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary">SUPER ADMIN DASHBOARD (CLOUD INTEGRATED)</h1>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <button onclick="sinkronDataDariCloud(true)" class="px-3 py-2 bg-secondary text-white rounded-md font-semibold text-xs hover:bg-yellow-600">⚡ Sync Cloud</button>
                    <button onclick="logout()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-md font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-red-700">Tutup Modus Admin</button>
                </div>
            </header>
            <main class="flex-1 p-8 overflow-y-auto">
                <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Seluruh Data Ujian (Lintas Guru)</h2>
                        <button onclick="bersihkanSemuaData()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-red-700 shadow-sm font-medium">Hapus Cache Lokal</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden mb-8">
                        <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200" id="tabel-nilai-admin">
                            <thead class="bg-gray-800 text-white">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Waktu</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Token Guru</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Nama Siswa</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Kelas</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Asal Sekolah</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Nilai</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Aksi</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200" id="tbody-admin-dash"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 mt-8">Manajemen Akses Guru (Cloud Sheet)</h2>
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden">
                        <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200">
                            <thead class="bg-gray-800 text-white">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Nama Guru</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Token Ujian</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">PIN Keamanan</th>
                                    <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider">Aksi</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200" id="tbody-admin-guru"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </main>
